<svg viewBox="216 380 808 518" role="img" aria-labelledby="t d">
<title id="tt-t">KlassApp isometric layer tower</title>
<desc id="tt-d">An isometric tower of three stacked layers  -  a dark protocol slab carrying three small cores, a green KlassApp core block, and a floating clay Toshi block topped by an upright tile bearing the KlassApp K mark. The integrated tools  -  WhatsApp, Google Drive and Slack  -  surface one at a time on the green core block's two visible faces, each growing out of the surface, holding, and sinking back in. The six AI models behind Toshi do the same on the clay block above: Anthropic, OpenAI, Grok, Gemini, Kimi and Z.ai, one at a time.</desc>
<defs>
<radialGradient id="tt-fade" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse" cx="620" cy="700" r="400"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#fff"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#fff" stop-opacity=".7"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#fff" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient>
<mask id="tt-floorMask"><rect x="80" y="560" width="1090" height="338" fill="url(#tt-fade)"/></mask>
